#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/visuals/ErrorAccess.tscn
msgid "The [code]set_angular_speed()[/code] function can't use the [code]angular_speed[/code] variable because it isn't script-wide. It also isn't in the [code]set_angular_speed()[/code] function."
msgstr "function [code]set_angular_speed()[/code] មិនអាច ប្រើអថេរ [code]angular_speed[/code] បានទេ ព្រោះវាមិនមែនជា អថេរកម្រិត script ទេ។ វាក៏ មិនស្ថិត ក្នុង function [code]set_angular_speed()[/code] ដែរ។"

#: course/lesson-12-using-variables/visuals/ErrorAccess.tscn
msgid "Make sure you define the [code]angular_speed[/code] variable in the [code]set_angular_speed()[/code] function, or define it outside of functions so it's script-wide."
