msgstr "បង្រៀន បង្កើតហ្គេម ក្នុងថ្នាក់រៀន?"

#: ui/screens/end_screen/EndScreen.tscn
msgid "Get in touch"
msgstr "ទាក់ទង មកយើង"

#: ui/screens/end_screen/SponsorlessEndScreen.tscn
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "អបអរសាទរ!"

#: ui/screens/end_screen/SponsorlessEndScreen.tscn
msgid ""
"You completed Learn GDScript From Zero. You now have the basics you need to make games with the Godot game engine.\n"
"\n"
"You can keep learning with the free series Getting Started with Godot."
msgstr ""
"អ្នកបានបញ្ចប់ Learn GDScript From Zero ហើយ។ ឥឡូវនេះអ្នកមានមូលដ្ឋានគ្រឹះដែលអ្នកត្រូវការ ដើម្បីបង្កើតហ្គេមជាមួយ Godot game engine។\n"
"\n"
"អ្នកអាចបន្តការសិក្សាជាមួយស៊េរីឥតគិតថ្លៃ Getting Started with Godot។"

#: ui/screens/end_screen/SponsorlessEndScreen.tscn
