#: ui/screens/end_screen/SponsorlessEndScreen.tscn
msgid ""
"Like Godot, this app and course is free and open-source. \n"
"\n"
"You can find the app's source code and contribute translations here: Learn GDScript From Zero (Github repository)."
msgstr ""
"ដូចជា Godot ដែរ app និង វគ្គសិក្សានេះ គឺឥតគិតថ្លៃ និង open-source។\n"
"\n"
"អ្នកអាច ស្វែងរក source code របស់ app និងចូលរួម បកប្រែនៅទីនេះ៖ [url=https://github.com/GDQuest/learn-gdscript]Learn GDScript From Zero (Github repository)[/url]។"

#: ui/screens/lesson/UIBaseQuiz.tscn
msgid "Question"
msgstr "សំណួរ"

#: ui/screens/lesson/UIBaseQuiz.tscn
msgid ""
"You've already answered this quiz correctly before.\n"
"Feel free to try it again to refresh your memory!"
msgstr ""
"អ្នកបានឆ្លើយសំណួរនេះបានត្រឹមត្រូវរួចហើយពីមុន។\n"
"សូមសាកល្បងម្តងទៀតដើម្បីរំលឹកការចងចាំរបស់អ្នក!"

#: ui/screens/lesson/UIBaseQuiz.tscn
msgid "Explanation"
msgstr "ការពន្យល់"

